days in the last week and talk about the Russian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:10.000
invasion of Ukraine, but I want to zoom out&nbsp;
a little bit and take a little bit more of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.880
systemic big picture, 30000 foot view. You know,&nbsp;
one of the goals of Vladimir Putin and Russia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:23.360
for more than a decade now in earnest. And&nbsp;
you could argue really even longer than that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:30.000
is to weaken what's seen as the West, the United&nbsp;
States and Europe. Or, you know, you could sort of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.680
