00:00:54.640 --> 00:01:02.400
Russia and China, the worse any one of them looks,&nbsp;
the better by comparison, others look. And so when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:09.760
we think back to the Trump era and we wonder or&nbsp;
we don't really have to wonder, but we think about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:17.280
why Putin would want and benefited from Trump&nbsp;
rather than Hillary Clinton being president.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:22.320
And chaos electorally in claims about voter fraud&nbsp;
and all these things. Why does Putin benefit from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:29.200
that? Well, when you step back and look at the&nbsp;
three major powers, if the U.S. looks silly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:36.160
if the US look stupid, if the U.S. looks so&nbsp;
ignorant that there are enough people that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

