his invasion of Ukraine has sort of accidentally&nbsp;
or as a side effect, unified and strengthened the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:16.480
West to the extent that the West is now very&nbsp;
clear, with some exceptions. You know, you&nbsp;&nbsp;

