ours have absolutely been affected by them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:57.440
If you look at any of our platforms. That is down&nbsp;
dramatically, it seems, because they are at least&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:06.800
to some degree preoccupied with trying to justify&nbsp;
this invasion of Ukraine. And the next months,&nbsp;&nbsp;

